# Web Nginx Config (Flutter SPA + Static)

## Why
go_router uses browser history mode. Default nginx serves 404 on refresh at /session/:id.
Custom nginx.conf must exist at docker/nginx/default.conf and be COPYed in Dockerfile.

## Required behavior
- try_files fallback to /index.html for any unknown path
- Cache-Control: immutable, max-age=31536000 for /main.dart.js, /flutter.js, /canvaskit/*, /assets/*
- Cache-Control: no-cache for /index.html
- Content-Security-Policy header (see plan for policy)
- gzip on for js/json/css/svg

## Do not remove
- Don't remove nginx.conf or the COPY line in Dockerfile
- Don't change target port from 80 (Fly.io `internal_port` and local compose map to it)
